# Files that must never be served publicly by the Worker's ASSETS binding.
# wrangler's assets.directory is "." (repo root) with run_worker_first, so
# anything not explicitly routed by src/worker.js falls through to a raw
# static-file response for whatever exists on disk -- this is the guard
# against accidentally publishing internal files that way.
#
# NOTE: adding this file makes wrangler stop falling back to .gitignore for
# asset exclusion, so everything from .gitignore has to be repeated here too
# -- see that file for the source list. Keep the two in sync.

# from .gitignore
node_modules/
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example
*.log

# internal-only, not meant to be public
.mcp.json
.claude/
docs/
*.md
.git/
.gitignore
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
migrations/
test/
src/
schema.sql
remove_blue.py
